<title>POLAND: Viscoplast turns to loss in Q2.</title>
<headline>Viscoplast turns to loss in Q2.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Viscoplast preliminary results for the second  quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 1.65 vs	1.38</p>
<p>    pre-tax loss			     2.71 vs	1.31 profit</p>
<p>    net loss				   1.92 vs	0.55 profit</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Viscoplast SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 14.03 vs     11.99</p>
<p>    costs of sales			   9.09 vs	6.32</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		     4.89 vs	0.10 profit</p>
<p>    income tax		  refund     0.79 vs	0.76</p>
<p>    other taxes				  na vs	  na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.60 vs	0.09</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.07 vs	0.25</p>
<p>    investment				 0.28 vs	1.13</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 2.92 vs	2.11</p>
<p>    pre-tax loss			     1.23 vs	1.90 profit</p>
<p>    net loss				   1.23 vs	0.89 profit</p>
<p>    net sales				 26.67 vs     22.20</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  17.92 vs     15.78</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		     4.74 vs	0.10 profit</p>
<p>    income tax				   na vs	1.01</p>
<p>    other taxes				  na vs	  na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.76 vs	0.16</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.16 vs	0.46</p>
<p>    investment				 0.64 vs	1.25</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
